# core-geth-website
#
# This repository is public, and a push to main publishes the site. This file is
# the gate between what stays on a contributor's machine and what reaches a clone.
# Verify it by effect, never by reading the patterns:
#
#   git -c core.excludesFile=/dev/null check-ignore --no-index -q -- <path>
#
# Exit 0 means ignored. Calibrate against a path that must NOT be ignored, such
# as README.md: a check that cannot report "not ignored" checks nothing.

# ---- Build and dependency output ---------------------------------------------
#
# Build output is anchored to the repository root. An unanchored directory
# pattern matches at every depth and silently ignores tracked source that happens
# to share the name. node_modules/ is left unanchored because an install
# directory is never source, at any depth.
node_modules/
/dist/
/.astro/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log

# ---- Environment files ---------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
# An example file is a template and must reach a clone. End-anchored, so
# .env.example.local stays ignored.
!.env*.example
# direnv exports secrets into the shell, and .env* does not match these.
.envrc
.direnv/

# ---- Keys, certificates and credentials ----------------------------------------
#
# These apply at every depth on purpose: a key dropped anywhere in the tree is
# still a key. A content directory named keystore or secrets is therefore never
# committed, so give it another name.
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
id_rsa
id_ecdsa
id_ed25519
credentials.json
service-account.json
secrets/
keystore/
*.keystore
wallet.json
mnemonic.txt

# ---- Package-registry auth -----------------------------------------------------
#
# A project .npmrc is where a registry auth token lives. Ignored with no
# carve-out: this project's pnpm settings belong in pnpm-workspace.yaml.
.npmrc
.yarnrc
.yarnrc.yml

# ---- Claude Code ------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# .claude/ is TRACKED, so repo-local agents, skills and rules travel with the
# repository. Only machine-local and agent-written state is held back. Do not
# replace this with a blanket .claude/ ignore: an agent inside an ignored
# directory never reaches a clone.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/agent-memory-local/
.claude/launch.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.json
.claude/**/*.local.*
.claude/**/*-local/
CLAUDE.local.md

# ---- Local working material -------------------------------------------------------
.local/
SESSION_NOTES.md
PLANNING.md
SCRATCH.md
*.scratch.*
*.draft.*

# ---- Editor and OS ------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/settings.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
